{"seq":1,"slug":"graphics-pipeline-overview","title":"图形渲染管线概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/graphics-pipeline-overview","wordCount":1571,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图形渲染管线概述\">图形渲染管线概述</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图形渲染管线（Graphics Pipeline）是 GPU 将三维场景数据转化为二维屏幕像素的完整处理流程。理解管线的每个阶段及其数据流动方式，是掌握游戏图形编程的基础。现代 GPU 管线从最初的固定功能管线演进为高度可编程的架构，开发者可以通过着色器程序精确控制渲染过程中的关键环节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[应用阶段] --&gt; B[顶点着色器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[曲面细分]&#10;    C --&gt; D[几何着色器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[光栅化]&#10;    E --&gt; F[片段着色器]&#10;    F --&gt; G[输出合并]&#10;    subgraph CPU 端&#10;        A&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GPU 可编程阶段&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        F&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GPU 固定功能&#10;        E&#10;        G&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[应用阶段] --&gt; B[顶点着色器]\n    B --&gt; C[曲面细分]\n    C --&gt; D[几何着色器]\n    D --&gt; E[光栅化]\n    E --&gt; F[片段着色器]\n    F --&gt; G[输出合并]\n    subgraph CPU 端\n        A\n    end\n    subgraph GPU 可编程阶段\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        F\n    end\n    subgraph GPU 固定功能\n        E\n        G\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管线阶段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>可编程性</th>\n<th>主要职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用阶段</td>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>完全可控</td>\n<td>场景管理、剔除、Draw Call 提交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶点着色器</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>可编程</td>\n<td>坐标变换、法线计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>曲面细分</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>可编程</td>\n<td>动态增加几何细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几何着色器</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>可编程</td>\n<td>生成/销毁图元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光栅化</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>固定功能</td>\n<td>图元转为片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>片段着色器</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>可编程</td>\n<td>逐像素光照与纹理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出合并</td>\n<td>GPU</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>深度测试、混合、写入帧缓冲</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>管线的核心设计哲学是流水线并行：当 GPU 处理第 N 帧的片段着色时，顶点着色器可以同时处理第 N+1 帧的顶点数据。这种深度流水线架构使得 GPU 能够在单帧内处理数百万个三角形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用阶段与-draw-call-优化\">应用阶段与 Draw Call 优化</h2><p>应用阶段运行在 CPU 上，负责准备 GPU 所需的全部数据。这个阶段的效率直接决定了渲染性能的上限，因为 CPU 与 GPU 之间的通信开销往往是性能瓶颈所在。</p>\n<p>应用阶段的核心任务包括场景遍历、视锥体剔除（Frustum Culling）、遮挡剔除（Occlusion Culling）以及排序和批处理。每次 CPU 向 GPU 提交渲染命令时都会产生一个 Draw Call，而 Draw Call 的数量是影响 CPU 端渲染性能的关键指标。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[场景图遍历] --&gt; B[视锥体剔除]&#10;    B --&gt; C[遮挡剔除]&#10;    C --&gt; D[排序与分组]&#10;    D --&gt; E[状态设置]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Draw Call 提交]&#10;    D --&gt; G{是否可批处理}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[实例化渲染]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| F&#10;    H --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[场景图遍历] --&gt; B[视锥体剔除]\n    B --&gt; C[遮挡剔除]\n    C --&gt; D[排序与分组]\n    D --&gt; E[状态设置]\n    E --&gt; F[Draw Call 提交]\n    D --&gt; G{是否可批处理}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[实例化渲染]\n    G --&gt;|否| F\n    H --&gt; F</pre><p>减少 Draw Call 的常用策略如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>性能提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态合批</td>\n<td>合并相同材质的静态网格</td>\n<td>不移动的场景物体</td>\n<td>显著降低 DC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态合批</td>\n<td>运行时合并小网格</td>\n<td>顶点数少的动态物体</td>\n<td>中等降低 DC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPU 实例化</td>\n<td>一次 DC 绘制多个实例</td>\n<td>大量相同物体（草、树）</td>\n<td>大幅降低 DC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间接绘制</td>\n<td>GPU 驱动 DC 参数</td>\n<td>Compute Shader 剔除后</td>\n<td>GPU 端剔除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 WebGL/WebGPU 环境中，实例化渲染是最常用的优化手段之一：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const instanceCount = 1000;&#10;const instanceBuffer = device.createBuffer({&#10;  size: instanceCount * 16 * 4,&#10;  usage: GPUBufferUsage.VERTEX | GPUBufferUsage.COPY_DST,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const matrices: Float32Array = new Float32Array(instanceCount * 16);&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; instanceCount; i++) {&#10;  const offset = i * 16;&#10;  mat4.fromTranslation(matrices.subarray(offset, offset + 16) as unknown as mat4, [&#10;    Math.random() * 100 - 50,&#10;    0,&#10;    Math.random() * 100 - 50,&#10;  ]);&#10;}&#10;device.queue.writeBuffer(instanceBuffer, 0, matrices);&#10;&#10;passEncoder.setPipeline(renderPipeline);&#10;passEncoder.setVertexBuffer(0, vertexBuffer);&#10;passEncoder.setVertexBuffer(1, instanceBuffer);&#10;passEncoder.draw(vertexCount, instanceCount);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instanceCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instanceBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  size: instanceCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  usage: GPUBufferUsage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">VERTEX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GPUBufferUsage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COPY_DST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> matrices</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instanceCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instanceCount; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> offset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mat4.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromTranslation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(matrices.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subarray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(offset, offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mat4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device.queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instanceBuffer, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, matrices);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">passEncoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(renderPipeline);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">passEncoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setVertexBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vertexBuffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">passEncoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setVertexBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, instanceBuffer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">passEncoder.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">draw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vertexCount, instanceCount);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"坐标空间与变换矩阵\">坐标空间与变换矩阵</h2><p>渲染管线中的顶点数据会经历一系列坐标空间变换，从模型的本地空间最终映射到屏幕像素坐标。每次变换都通过矩阵乘法完成，理解这些坐标空间的关系对于正确实现各种视觉效果至关重要。</p>\n<p>变换流程为：模型空间 → 世界空间 → 观察空间 → 裁剪空间 → NDC → 屏幕空间。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>坐标空间</th>\n<th>变换矩阵</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型空间</td>\n<td>Model Matrix</td>\n<td>物体自身坐标系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>世界空间</td>\n<td>View Matrix</td>\n<td>场景全局坐标系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察空间</td>\n<td>Projection Matrix</td>\n<td>以相机为原点的坐标系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>裁剪空间</td>\n<td>透视除法</td>\n<td>齐次坐标 w 分量不为 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NDC 空间</td>\n<td>视口变换</td>\n<td>归一化设备坐标 [-1, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕空间</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>最终像素坐标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在顶点着色器中，典型的 MVP 变换如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"#version 450&#10;&#10;layout(binding = 0) uniform Matrices {&#10;    mat4 model;&#10;    mat4 view;&#10;    mat4 projection;&#10;};&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) in vec3 inPosition;&#10;layout(location = 1) in vec3 inNormal;&#10;layout(location = 2) in vec2 inTexCoord;&#10;&#10;layout(location = 0) out vec3 fragWorldPos;&#10;layout(location = 1) out vec3 fragNormal;&#10;layout(location = 2) out vec2 fragTexCoord;&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec4 worldPos = model * vec4(inPosition, 1.0);&#10;    fragWorldPos = worldPos.xyz;&#10;    fragNormal = mat3(transpose(inverse(model))) * inNormal;&#10;    fragTexCoord = inTexCoord;&#10;    gl_Position = projection * view * worldPos;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#version 450</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(binding = 0) uniform Matrices {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mat4 model;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mat4 view;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mat4 projection;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) in vec3 inPosition;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) in vec3 inNormal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 2) in vec2 inTexCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 0) out vec3 fragWorldPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 1) out vec3 fragNormal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(location = 2) out vec2 fragTexCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec4 worldPos = model * vec4(inPosition, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fragWorldPos = worldPos.xyz;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fragNormal = mat3(transpose(inverse(model))) * inNormal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fragTexCoord = inTexCoord;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    gl_Position = projection * view * worldPos;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>需要注意，法线变换不能直接使用 Model 矩阵，而需要使用其逆转置矩阵（Normal Matrix），以保证在存在非均匀缩放时法线方向仍然正确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gpu-资源管理与状态机\">GPU 资源管理与状态机</h2><p>GPU 渲染本质上是一个状态机系统。在提交 Draw Call 之前，需要设置完整的渲染状态，包括着色器程序、顶点布局、混合模式、深度测试配置等。状态切换是有开销的，减少不必要的状态切换是优化的重要方向。</p>\n<p>现代图形 API（Vulkan、DirectX 12、Metal、WebGPU）引入了渲染管线状态对象（Pipeline State Object, PSO）的概念，将大量渲染状态预编译为不可变对象，大幅减少运行时验证开销。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const pipeline = device.createRenderPipeline({&#10;  layout: pipelineLayout,&#10;  vertex: {&#10;    module: vertexShaderModule,&#10;    entryPoint: &#39;main&#39;,&#10;    buffers: [&#10;      {&#10;        arrayStride: 32,&#10;        attributes: [&#10;          { shaderLocation: 0, offset: 0, format: &#39;float32x3&#39; },&#10;          { shaderLocation: 1, offset: 12, format: &#39;float32x3&#39; },&#10;          { shaderLocation: 2, offset: 24, format: &#39;float32x2&#39; },&#10;        ],&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;  fragment: {&#10;    module: fragmentShaderModule,&#10;    entryPoint: &#39;main&#39;,&#10;    targets: [{ format: presentationFormat }],&#10;  },&#10;  depthStencil: {&#10;    depthWriteEnabled: true,&#10;    depthCompare: &#39;less&#39;,&#10;    format: &#39;depth24plus&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  primitive: {&#10;    topology: &#39;triangle-list&#39;,&#10;    cullMode: &#39;back&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pipeline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createRenderPipeline</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  layout: pipelineLayout,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vertex: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    module: vertexShaderModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entryPoint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    buffers: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        arrayStride: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        attributes: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { shaderLocation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'float32x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { shaderLocation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'float32x3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          { shaderLocation: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, offset: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'float32x2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fragment: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    module: fragmentShaderModule,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    entryPoint: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    targets: [{ format: presentationFormat }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  depthStencil: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    depthWriteEnabled: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    depthCompare: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'less'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'depth24plus'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  primitive: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    topology: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'triangle-list'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cullMode: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'back'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在传统 OpenGL 中，状态切换的开销排序大致为：着色器程序切换 &gt; 纹理绑定 &gt; 顶点缓冲切换 &gt; Uniform 更新。因此在排序 Draw Call 时，应优先按着色器分组，其次按纹理分组，最后按网格分组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"帧缓冲与渲染目标\">帧缓冲与渲染目标</h2><p>渲染的最终结果写入帧缓冲（Framebuffer），帧缓冲由多个渲染目标（Render Target）组成。除了默认的屏幕帧缓冲外，开发者可以创建自定义的 FBO（Framebuffer Object），实现离屏渲染（Off-screen Rendering），这是后处理、阴影贴图、延迟渲染等技术的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 帧缓冲&#10;        A[颜色附件 0 - Albedo]&#10;        B[颜色附件 1 - Normal]&#10;        C[颜色附件 2 - Position]&#10;        D[深度/模板附件]&#10;    end&#10;    E[MRT 渲染] --&gt; A&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    E --&gt; C&#10;    E --&gt; D&#10;    A --&gt; F[后处理管线]&#10;    B --&gt; F&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[最终输出]\">graph TD\n    subgraph 帧缓冲\n        A[颜色附件 0 - Albedo]\n        B[颜色附件 1 - Normal]\n        C[颜色附件 2 - Position]\n        D[深度/模板附件]\n    end\n    E[MRT 渲染] --&gt; A\n    E --&gt; B\n    E --&gt; C\n    E --&gt; D\n    A --&gt; F[后处理管线]\n    B --&gt; F\n    C --&gt; F\n    D --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[最终输出]</pre><p>多渲染目标（MRT, Multiple Render Targets）允许片段着色器在一次绘制中同时输出到多个颜色附件。这是 G-Buffer 延迟渲染的关键技术：一次几何 Pass 即可将 Albedo、法线、世界坐标等信息分别写入不同的纹理。</p>\n<p>帧缓冲的格式选择直接影响显存占用和带宽：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>位深</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>带宽成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RGBA8</td>\n<td>32 bit</td>\n<td>基础颜色输出</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGBA16F</td>\n<td>64 bit</td>\n<td>HDR 渲染、法线</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RGBA32F</td>\n<td>128 bit</td>\n<td>高精度计算</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Depth24Stencil8</td>\n<td>32 bit</td>\n<td>深度 + 模板</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Depth32F</td>\n<td>32 bit</td>\n<td>高精度深度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在移动端 GPU（Tile-Based Deferred Rendering 架构）上，帧缓冲的使用策略需要特别注意。应尽量避免不必要的 Resolve 操作，利用 Subpass 在 Tile 内存中完成多 Pass 渲染，避免将中间结果写回主存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((图形渲染管线))&#10;    应用阶段&#10;      场景管理&#10;      Draw Call 优化&#10;      实例化渲染&#10;    坐标变换&#10;      MVP 矩阵&#10;      法线矩阵&#10;      六大坐标空间&#10;    GPU 状态管理&#10;      PSO 预编译&#10;      状态排序&#10;      现代 API 架构&#10;    帧缓冲&#10;      MRT 多目标&#10;      格式选择&#10;      Tile-Based 架构\">mindmap\n  root((图形渲染管线))\n    应用阶段\n      场景管理\n      Draw Call 优化\n      实例化渲染\n    坐标变换\n      MVP 矩阵\n      法线矩阵\n      六大坐标空间\n    GPU 状态管理\n      PSO 预编译\n      状态排序\n      现代 API 架构\n    帧缓冲\n      MRT 多目标\n      格式选择\n      Tile-Based 架构</pre><ul>\n<li>渲染管线由 CPU 应用阶段和 GPU 多个可编程/固定功能阶段组成，流水线并行是其高性能的核心</li>\n<li>Draw Call 优化（合批、实例化、间接绘制）是 CPU 端性能的关键</li>\n<li>顶点经历模型空间到屏幕空间共六次坐标变换，法线需要使用逆转置矩阵</li>\n<li>现代图形 API 通过 PSO 预编译减少运行时状态验证开销</li>\n<li>帧缓冲与 MRT 是离屏渲染、延迟渲染、后处理等高级技术的基础</li>\n<li>移动端 Tile-Based 架构需要特殊的帧缓冲使用策略以优化带宽</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图形渲染管线概述","id":"图形渲染管线概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"应用阶段与 Draw Call 优化","id":"应用阶段与-draw-call-优化"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标空间与变换矩阵","id":"坐标空间与变换矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 资源管理与状态机","id":"gpu-资源管理与状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"帧缓冲与渲染目标","id":"帧缓冲与渲染目标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"顶点处理与变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-graphics/rendering-pipeline/vertex-processing"}}